<p>I'm not a fan of the huge amount of technobabble, though, and this and constant references to other documents makes it really hard to follow at some times.</p>
<p>EDIT : although in this case, the constant technobabble and references gives the skip a particular style I can't really describe, it feels different from other skips, and I like it.</p>

