</ul>
<ul>
<li>I started to add a bunch of addenda to create a feeling of accumulated changes in containment policies over decades</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>I got interested in the idea that it would start being neglected, and felt like it would be really different to make the scariness come from the Foundation ignoring important stuff</li>
