<li>From then on I needed another point of view to emphasize that the item is very important despite being just a harmless rock</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>I got caught up into the side-story about the in-fighting within the Foundation, and started putting as much effort into developing both the item itself and the side-story.</li>
